  "title": "REPAY to Announce Second Quarter 2026 Results on August 10, 2026",
  "summary": "ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Jul. 27, 2026-- Repay Holdings Corporation (NASDAQ: RPAY) (“REPAY” or the “Company”), a leading provider of bill payment solutions, today announced that the Company will host a conference call to discuss second quarter 2026 financial results on Monday, August 10, 2026 at 5:00pm ET. A press release with second quarter 2026 financial results will be issued after the market […]",
